ل الفناء مدبلج الحلقة 80","poster":"https://3iskk.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/1-83.jpg","posterShape":"poster","background":"https://3iskk.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/1-83.jpg","landscapePoster":"https://3iskk.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/1-83.jpg","logo":"https://3esk.onl/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/3isk-logo.png","description":"مسلسل الفناء مدبلج الحلقة 80 — 3isk (قصة عشق)"},{"id":"akwam_series__5883__best-medicine-~d8~a7~d9~84~d9~85~d9~88~d8~b3~d9~85-~d8~a7~d9~84~d8~ab~d8~a7~d9~86~d9~8a","type":"series","name":"Best Medicine الموسم الثاني","poster":"https://img.downet.net/thumb/178x260/uploads/q5EEv.webp","posterShape":"poster","background":"https://img.downet.net/thumb/178x260/uploads/q5EEv.webp","landscapePoster":"https://img.downet.net/thumb/178x260/uploads/q5EEv.webp","logo":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQ2vuGLv4zY3XpoN2jza2unCQ95xFfypfe-h3k3xteMbGxl7taw-ziXyNg&s=10","description":"Best Medicine الموسم الثاني — Akwam (أكوام)","imdbRating":"7.0"},{"id":"cine_1215797","slug":"cinemana-1215797","type":"series","name":"Watashi no Shiawase na Kekkon","poster":"https://cnth2.shabakaty.cc/vascin-poster-images/F95035CF-CC63-3B0C-E90F-0BF6BFCEA803_poster.jpg","posterShape":"poster","background":"https://cnth2.shabakaty.cc/vascin-poster-images/F95035CF-CC63-3B0C-E90F-0BF6BFCEA803_poster.jpg","landscapePoster":"https://cnth2.shabakaty.cc/vascin-poster-images/F95035CF-CC63-3B0C-E90F-0BF6BFCEA803_poster.jpg","description":"هل هذا الزواج نعمة؟ أم لعنة؟ وُلدت ميو سايموري بلا موهبة لعائلة نبيلة تشتهر بقدراتها الخارقة للطبيعة وأجبرت ميو سايموري على العيش في حالة من الاستعباد من قبل زوجة أبيها المؤذية. عندما بلغت ميو أخيرًا سن الزواج تلاشت آمالها في الانتقال بعيدًا إلى حياة أفضل بعد أن اكتشفت هوية خطيبها: كيوكا كودو وهو القائد البارد والقاسي على ما يبدو لدرجة أن عرائسه المحتملات قد هربن جميعًا في غضون ثلاثة أيام من إعلان الخطوبة. مع عدم وجود مكان تلجأ إليه تستسلم ميو لمصيرها\n\nBorn talentless to a noble family famous for their supernatural abilities, Saimori Miyo is forced into an existence of servitude by her abusive stepmother. When Miyo finally comes of marriageable age, though, her hopes of being whisked away to a better life crumble after she discovers her fiancé's identity: Kudou Kiyoka, a commander apparently so cold and cruel that his previous would-be brides all fled within three days of their engagements. With no home to return to, Miyo resigns herself to her fate—and soon finds that her pale and beautiful husband-to-be is anything but the monster she expected. As they slowly open their hearts to each other, both realize the other may be their chance at finding true love and happiness.","releaseInfo":"2023","imdbRating":"6.6","genres":["رسوم متحركة | Animation","دراما | Drama","خيالي | Fantasy","رومانسي | Romance"]}]}
